<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Đặt chỗ thành công</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 h-screen flex items-center justify-center">

    <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-2xl shadow-xl text-center max-w-lg">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-green-100 text-green-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 text-4xl">
            ✓
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Cảm ơn bạn!</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">
            Chúng tôi đã nhận được yêu cầu đặt chỗ của <strong><%= info.fullname %></strong>.<br>
            Gói: <strong><%= info.planName %></strong><br>
            Ngày: <strong><%= info.date %></strong>
        </p>
        
        <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-[#BA2636] text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:opacity-90">
            Trở về trang chủ
        </a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>